      "title": "Deployment queue controls \u2014 overall success rate (5m)",
      "id": 204,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 160
      },
      "description": "\u00a712 success-rate tile across all 4 queue-control ops (cancel / reorder / clear / clear-obsolete). Numerator: apid_ops_total{op=~\"deployment_(cancel|reorder|clear|clear_obsolete)\",outcome=\"ok\"}; denominator: same set, all outcomes. Thresholds mirror build-success tile: green \u22650.95, yellow 0.80-0.95, red <0.80. A sustained red means either a state-machine regression (live_forbidden, not_pending, not_cancellable) or a real error burst.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(apid_ops_total{op=~\"deployment_(cancel|reorder|clear|clear_obsolete)\",outcome=\"ok\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(apid_ops_total{op=~\"deployment_(cancel|reorder|clear|clear_obsolete)\"}[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "success rate",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
